# Markdown docs — excluded from Prettier's scope. Its default markdown formatter doesn't just
# touch whitespace: it re-indents multi-line list-item continuations and can shift them out of the
# list item's content block entirely (confirmed by testing it against CONTRIBUTING.md, reverted),
# which risks silently changing how a doc renders, not just its source formatting. Not worth that
# risk for prose docs — Prettier's real value here is JS/TS/JSON, not markdown.
